	</p>
<h3><a name="amendmentsecondsb" id="amendmentsecondsb">Amendment Seconds B</a></h3>
      <ol>
      <li>Frans Pop [<a href="mailto:fjp@debian.org">fjp@debian.org</a>] [<a href='https://lists.debian.org/debian-vote/2009/03/msg00230.html'>mail</a>] </li>
      <li>Rapha&euml;l Hertzog [<a href="mailto:hertzog@debian.org">hertzog@debian.org</a>] [<a href='https://lists.debian.org/debian-vote/2009/03/msg00242.html'>mail</a>] </li>
